{"title": "Permanent Mind Sanctuary", "pageid": 27650, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Permanent_Mind_Sanctuary", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters", "Illithid Powers"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mind_Sanctuary.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Mind_Sanctuary.webp/300px-Mind_Sanctuary.webp, /w/images/9/94/Mind_Sanctuary.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Mind_Sanctuary.webp/300px-Mind_Sanctuary.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Mind_Sanctuary.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Permanent Mind Sanctuary</b> is a passive feature and <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Illithid Power\">Illithid Power</a>. This passive lets the creature use actions and bonus actions interchangeably.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You can use actions and bonus actions interchangeably. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Permanent_Mind_Sanctuary\"> Condition: Permanent Mind Sanctuary </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Permanent_Mind_Sanctuary_(Condition)\" title=\"Permanent Mind Sanctuary (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Permanent Mind Sanctuary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Permanent_Mind_Sanctuary_(Condition)\" title=\"Permanent Mind Sanctuary (Condition)\">Permanent Mind Sanctuary</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>While in combat, Mind Flayers can use actions and bonus actions interchangeably.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Full-illithid\" title=\"Full-illithid\">Full-illithid</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714212717\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 797/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5838/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1878/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 142/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643748/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.862      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   30.862      1 -total\n 44.52%   13.741      1 Template:Condition\n 30.7